      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Por fin llegó al monte Parnaso, una montaña alta, con acantilados empinados y un manantial claro.",
          "en": "At last he came to Mount Parnassus, a high mountain with steep cliffs and a clear spring."
        },
        {
          "es": "El lugar se llamaba Pitó. Más tarde, la gente lo llamaría Delfos.",
          "en": "The place was called Pytho. Later, people would call it Delphi."
        },
        {
          "es": "A Apolo le gustó enseguida. Aquí construiría su templo.",
          "en": "Apollo liked it at once. Here he would build his temple."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero el manantial tenía un guardián. Era Pitón.",
          "en": "But the spring had a guard. It was Python."
        }
      ],
